,{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"kb1Tf4xwb7CQW5OXf9zwqw","review_id":"vGSB-L4XfJ7dYPchC_7xHg","date":"2017-09-18T01:11:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9461043477058411,"text_excerpt":"WOW. OMG. Meeeeeeaaaaaaatttt!!! I had dinner here Friday night with friends and left with a healthy, 5 pound, bouncing food baby. I suggest reservations because Toups gets busy, and it's easy to see why. We started with the Meatery Board and I was blown away. We all loved EVERY item on the board. There was chicken liver mousse (my favorite), smoked pastrami, candied pork belly, hogs head cheese, sausage, a boudin ball, pickled veggies, and a basket of crackins. The cracklins were hot and crispy, and with almost every bite you'd get a little hot, delicious drop of grease. Not regular grease - straight up melted pork fat!! I'm not going to pretend to be all uppity - I love a pop of melted p..."},{"business_id":"kb1Tf4xwb7CQW5OXf9zwqw","review_id":"oXy7FWqe3XoOzHInN-J9Rw","date":"2018-08-22T13:57:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9435211420059204,"text_excerpt":"The charcuterie board was for me the star of the night and a great deal. I've always been one that likes to nibble on things and have a little taste of a lot of things. It essentially gives you a taste of almost everything on the Small Plates menu (except the last three - at least for that night). I loved the sausage of the day, along with the pickled veggies sprinkled throughout the platter. Thoroughly enjoyed the pork rillete and also the little nuggets of cracklins, although by itself, the meat was a bit dry. The skin was crispy and super tasty. We dipped the cracklins into the paté and was a great combo. We tried the duck breast, lamb neck and venison. My friends enjoyed the venison t..."},{"business_id":"kb1Tf4xwb7CQW5OXf9zwqw","review_id":"z3h2dftfP_Uwg2vB2kQ0lw","date":"2020-07-26T20:57:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9387033581733704,"text_excerpt":"We live right down the road in Mid-City, but have never made it here. Changed that today when we visited for brunch on a Sunday. We had a bottomless mimosa and a bloody mary, both great. For food, we absolutely ordered way too much, and did not regret it a bit (leftovers FTW). We had: 1. The meat board - just incredible. This is their specialty, after all, so I was not surprised, but the sausage was perfect, the pate was really tasty, the fried turkey neck was messy as hell but tasty, and all the pickles and other items were killer. The cracklins alone were so good that I could probably eat my weight in them. WOW. 2. Buttermilk Fried Chicken Sandwich - this is maybe some of the best chick..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"kb1Tf4xwb7CQW5OXf9zwqw","photo_id":"r6HwWGyI3ahEl5kQq9tNOw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/r6HwWGyI3ahEl5kQq9tNOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9474072456359863},{"business_id":"kb1Tf4xwb7CQW5OXf9zwqw","photo_id":"pApOqDD03UoPEVUDQqq-kQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pApOqDD03UoPEVUDQqq-kQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8471543192863464},{"business_id":"kb1Tf4xwb7CQW5OXf9zwqw","photo_id":"JpV6HhuuuFgAH8d_VjqBuw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/JpV6HhuuuFgAH8d_VjqBuw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8327903747558594},{"business_id":"kb1Tf4xwb7C